// LocalLlama.xcconfig — is the inference engine vendored?
//
// Committed with the flag OFF, and overwritten by
// ios/scripts/build_llama_xcframework.sh when it has produced
// vendor/llama.xcframework.
//
// The alternative — deciding at `xcodegen generate` time — cannot work:
// XcodeGen does not evaluate disk state into a build setting, and a
// setting that claimed the framework was there when it was not would
// produce a link error rather than a clear message in the app.
//
// With this empty, LlamaRunner.swift compiles out entirely and
// LocalInference falls back to EchoRunner, which tells the user this
// build has no local engine. That is a legitimate build: someone
// changing a view should not need a twenty-minute llama.cpp compile.

HNX_LOCAL_LLAMA =
